{"ID":"20230928085135-2dq8li7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20230928085135-2dq8li7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085135-2dq8li7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085142-u9sukof\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085346-p6teon6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:633,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928085346-p6teon6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【手太阴肺经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173220"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912164457-667qo8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912164457-667qo8a","updated":"20240912173213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【手太阴肺经穴位】：中府穴、云门穴、天府穴、侠白穴、尺泽穴、孔最穴、列缺穴、经渠穴、太渊穴、鱼际穴、少商穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-u9sukof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-u9sukof","updated":"20230928085144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中医观念认为，肺是传导之官，治节出焉（所有身上的规矩，节度，都是肺脏在管）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085150-zlmfwe6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085150-zlmfwe6"}},{"ID":"20230928085142-11idge3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-11idge3","updated":"20230928085146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺藏魄；魄，顾名思义，白天见鬼，这个人看到不应该看的，就是魄有问题；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-i1teoj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-i1teoj2","updated":"20230928085145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺，气之本；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-n27ud9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-n27ud9n","updated":"20230928085146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（气即热气，蒸汽，可见的如呼气在玻璃成雾，这是气，或人的头发发油也是一种气的表现，这个油也是气形成的，如果一个人头发很油，那这个人气太旺，可以采取如运动的方式把气耗掉；）"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-jlmktaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-jlmktaz","updated":"20230928085154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺主皮毛，开窍在鼻；皮肤毛孔，都是肺在管；这个人皮肤好不好，也可以看出来这个人肺好不好；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-hs9e72g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-hs9e72g","updated":"20230928085156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（脸上的眉毛也是肺脏在管，所以眉毛跟头发、胡子不太一样，剃掉不容易长出来；如果一个人生活起居很好很规矩，饮食正常，这种人长寿，年龄大的时候眉毛就开始长，所以长眉相等于长寿）"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-kf4iua6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-kf4iua6","updated":"20230928085202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺主忧，因为有肺脏，所以才会有忧郁的情志，一旦忧太过时，则忧伤肺，可能导致眉毛脱落；（如果一个人咳嗽，然后心中又有忧虑的事情的时候，咳嗽不会好；可采取情志上化解，如火（心，主喜）克金（肺，主忧），所以让患者开心，就能把忧去掉，则咳嗽容易好）"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-0jt13ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-0jt13ue","updated":"20230928085203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺于五音中主商，（五音为宫商角徵羽），商声；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-qxz0z7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-qxz0z7j","updated":"20230928085204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（在五脏逼毒法中，如需逼出五脏之毒，如肺之毒，则要发出‘商’声；商的声音叫做呬/四（si，第四声））"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-ckp9vv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-ckp9vv0","updated":"20230928085205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"呵（心脏）嘘（肝脏）呼（胃）吹（肾）嘻（三焦）四（肺）"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-ykhftf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-ykhftf6","updated":"20230928085206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"五脏逼毒法：手指交叉尽量往上抬，脚尖着地；手掌上升时肋骨会往上升，上升同时胸腔好像会被压住，这个时候发出‘呬’的声音，发到彻底没有气了，再而提肛，发最后一个无声的呬；最后一步很重要；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-5jzqqw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-5jzqqw1","updated":"20230928085207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺属燥金；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085208-o6aem2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085208-o6aem2c"}},{"ID":"20230928085142-6ktdl6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-6ktdl6j","updated":"20230928085209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手太阴肺经穴位歌诀"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-9zh5hcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-9zh5hcy","updated":"20230928085211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手太阴肺十一穴，中府云门天府诀。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-ktditi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-ktditi3","updated":"20230928085211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"侠白尺泽孔最存，列缺经渠太渊涉。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-u7vf9va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-u7vf9va","updated":"20230928085212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鱼际拇指白肉际，抵指少商如韭叶。"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-mygbox0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-mygbox0","updated":"20230928085212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手太阴肺经起于中府，终于少商；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085215-fw7xql9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085215-fw7xql9"}},{"ID":"20230928085142-fdjpd9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-fdjpd9z","updated":"20230928085214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阴经："}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-sj5vnnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-sj5vnnk","updated":"20230928085217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（一定是手肘以下才有井荣俞经合，手肘以上没有）"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-cwtqun2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-cwtqun2","updated":"20230928085220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t木\t少商穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-abmjq3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-abmjq3m","updated":"20230928085221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t火\t鱼际穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-rj3y871","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-rj3y871","updated":"20230928085222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t土\t太渊穴\t母穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-knnkgzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-knnkgzc","updated":"20230928085252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t金\t经渠穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-63yw3fk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-63yw3fk","updated":"20230928085253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t水\t尺泽穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928085305-e77c43e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085305-e77c43e"}},{"ID":"20230928085142-8kq395p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-8kq395p","updated":"20230928085254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"手太阴肺经，多气少血；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085142-2y23ipe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085142-2y23ipe","updated":"20230928085300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肺脏法象天幕；皮毛如天幕版将人体包裹住；"}]},{"ID":"20230928085342-1uf0d58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928085342-1uf0d58","updated":"20240206090002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Ty